  "key_insights": [
    "full_pipeline F1 (0.165) is 4.8x higher than pdif_only F1 (0.034) \u2014 AMR pre-filter dramatically improves precision",
    "pdif_only has 89x more unvalidated detections (1733 vs 191) \u2014 AMR constraint eliminates ~89% of false positives",
    "5/12 plasmids (42%) lack AMR genes in AMRDB \u2014 they are invisible to the full pipeline but detected by pdif_only",
    "MF399199.1 (207kb, 6 AMR genes) has 0/1 detection in both modes \u2014 warrants investigation",
    "On AMR-positive plasmids, detection rates are IDENTICAL between modes (same pdif sites found)",
    "The AMR pre-filter acts as a precision/recall tradeoff: +0.081 precision, -0.233 recall"
  ]
